{"run_id": "splus-batch-b-s01-ff53d8", "t": 40.481, "at": "2026-11-13T19:32:15.282Z", "tool": "pulls_open", "role": "open_pr", "args": {"issue": "issue-4434", "branch": "repomind/issue-4434", "title": "Triage issue 4434", "body": "File: src/components/UploadForm.tsx\n\nIn src/components/UploadForm.tsx, the file input's onChange handler sets the file state using onChange={(e) => setFile(e.target.files?.[0] ?? null)}, but it does not clear the previous upload error (problem state) via setProblem(null). As reported in issue #4434, the old error and row number stay visible under the form until the user submits again."}, "plan_step": null, "key": "0f36a7d87c426152230fa0fe", "attempt": 1, "outcome": "ok", "is_error": false, "result": "{\"pull_request\": \"pr-59\", \"branch\": \"repomind/issue-4434\", \"state\": \"open\"}", "latency_s": 0.002, "cost_usd": 0.0}
{"run_id": "splus-batch-b-s01-ff53d8", "t": 40.493, "at": "2026-11-13T19:32:15.295Z", "tool": "issues_comment", "role": "comment", "args": {"issue": "issue-4434", "body": "label: bug\nfile: src/components/UploadForm.tsx\nThis comment was written by RepoMind, an automated triage agent. To reach a person, mention @ledgerline/maintainers.\n\nIn src/components/UploadForm.tsx, the file input's onChange handler sets the file state using onChange={(e) => setFile(e.target.files?.[0] ?? null)}, but it does not clear the previous upload error (problem state) via setProblem(null). As reported in issue #4434, the old error and row number stay visible under the form until the user submits again."}, "plan_step": null, "key": "35cea447dd7c11833abc44be", "attempt": 1, "outcome": "ok", "is_error": false, "result": "{\"comment\": \"comment-74\", \"issue\": \"issue-4434\"}", "latency_s": 0.001, "cost_usd": 0.0}
